      en: ["The company was established in the city of Celje in 1873.", "It specializes in the manufacturing of titanium dioxide pigments.", "Approximately 90% of its total output is exported internationally.", "One of the largest industrial employers in the Savinja region.", "The company currently employs more than 800 staff members.", "Significant investments have been made in advanced pollution control."],
