      en: ["Founded in the year 1945 by Rudi Finžgar in Begunje.", "Inventor of the first carving ski (MBX model) in the 1990s.", "Over 15,000 sailing yachts have been produced to date.", "Ingemar Stenmark won 86 World Cup races using Elan skis.", "The factory produces several hundred thousand pairs of skis annually.", "The world's first ski museum opened at the site in 2017."],
