      en: ["The company was founded in 1920 under the name Vulcan in the city of Kranj.", "Since 2004, Sava Tires has been 100% owned by the American Goodyear corporation.", "The Kranj plant produces more than 7 million tires annually for cars and trucks.", "Sava Tires employs more than 1,500 people at its Kranj headquarters.", "The factory supplies markets throughout Europe, the Middle East, and Africa.", "The Sava brand is well-known in the European tire market for its excellent value-for-money ratio."],
